/* The UESC's emblems (emblems/index.js). Its own AIs were Durandal --
 * Roland's sword -- and Tycho, so its callsigns are legendary blades,
 * Charlemagne's paladins and astronomers, and each is drawn as what it
 * names, the way the Marathon shows Durandal as a knight on a carousel
 * horse: a relic, an instrument, a figure out of the chronicle, lit from
 * the upper left, faceless. Three so far -- the Researcher, the Regex smith
 * and the Sentinel; any other callsign wears the unnamed one. Each is drawn
 * for the whole screen (components/EmblemViewer.jsx) as much as for a row
 * in the sidebar; `caption` is the line the viewer prints over it. */

